{"status":"ready","content":"Let's perform the division:\n\n**Dividend:** 123456789012345  \n**Divisor:** 98765\n\n### Step 1: Quotient\n\n\\[\n\\text{Quotient} = \\left\\lfloor \\frac{123456789012345}{98765} \\right\\rfloor\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\frac{123456789012345}{98765} \\approx 1,250,703,084.55\n\\]\n\nSo, the **quotient** is **1,250,703,084**.\n\n---\n\n### Step 2: Remainder\n\n\\[\n\\text{Remainder} = 123456789012345 - (98765 \\times 1,250,703,084)\n\\]\n\nFirst, calculate \\( 98765 \\times 1,250,703,084 = 123,456,789,011,860 \\).\n\nNow the remainder:\n\n\\[\n123,456,789,012,345 - 123,456,789,011,860 = 485\n\\]\n\n---\n\n## **Final Answer**\n\n- **Quotient:** 1,250,703,084\n- **Remainder:** 485\n","metadata":{"modelLabel":"GPT-4.1","modelId":"openai/gpt-4.1","promptId":"large-division","content":"Let's perform the division:\n\n**Dividend:** 123456789012345  \n**Divisor:** 98765\n\n### Step 1: Quotient\n\n\\[\n\\text{Quotient} = \\left\\lfloor \\frac{123456789012345}{98765} \\right\\rfloor\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\frac{123456789012345}{98765} \\approx 1,250,703,084.55\n\\]\n\nSo, the **quotient** is **1,250,703,084**.\n\n---\n\n### Step 2: Remainder\n\n\\[\n\\text{Remainder} = 123456789012345 - (98765 \\times 1,250,703,084)\n\\]\n\nFirst, calculate \\( 98765 \\times 1,250,703,084 = 123,456,789,011,860 \\).\n\nNow the remainder:\n\n\\[\n123,456,789,012,345 - 123,456,789,011,860 = 485\n\\]\n\n---\n\n## **Final Answer**\n\n- **Quotient:** 1,250,703,084\n- **Remainder:** 485\n","inferredMetadata":{"inferred":true,"sourcePath":"scripts/responses/gpt-4-1/large-division.txt","modelSlug":"gpt-4-1","modelFamily":"openai_flagship","modelReleaseDate":"Apr 2025","modelSource":"openrouter"},"prompt":{"id":"large-division","text":"Divide 123456789012345 by 98765 and give the quotient and remainder.","tags":["reasoning","math"]}},"path":"responses/gpt-4-1/large-division.json","size":1244,"mtime":1779392241}